==Battleground==
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 12~15.33 seconds<sup>360f~460f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 18.67~22 seconds<sup>560f~660f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 65 seconds<sup>1,950f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 75 seconds<sup>2,250f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] will easily clear this stage.

